{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/tools/layout,_N_T_/tools/[category]/layout,_N_T_/tools/[category]/[slug]/layout,_N_T_/tools/[category]/[slug]/page,_N_T_/tools/image/color-picker"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/tools/$d$category/$d$slug/__PAGE__","/tools/$d$category/$d$slug","/tools/$d$category","/tools","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\" class=\"geist_29008ace-module__qpOSqq__variable geist_mono_376e4c3c-module__Cf8Oda__variable\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.0r6juujl39pe6.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0wgildi0cnwt9.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0hwforhb7bb2y.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/3f7c1u3y47an2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/1gb6e7-1asl9f.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1fj6kbkj_syo6.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3j9pm5otqxm82.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-2kgwj_ji4063t.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/119u6-1buly1t.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1xk9sgipyme72.js\" async=\"\"></script><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-DBZT1K0P01\" as=\"script\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Image Color Picker - Extract HEX, RGB, HSL from Photos | Creators Units</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Extract HEX, RGB, and HSL colors from uploaded images or screenshots. Create custom palettes online. 100% private.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Creators Units\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"creator tools, image compressor, qr generator, youtube tag extractor, text case converter, fancy text generator, link in bio\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/image/color-picker\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Image Color Picker - Extract HEX, RGB, HSL from Photos | Creators Units\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Extract HEX, RGB, and HSL colors from uploaded images or screenshots. Create custom palettes online. 100% private.\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://creatorunits.com/og-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"Color Picker &amp; Extractor - Creators Units\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Image Color Picker - Extract HEX, RGB, HSL from Photos | Creators Units\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Extract HEX, RGB, and HSL colors from uploaded images or screenshots. Create custom palettes online. 100% private.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://creatorunits.com/og-image.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Creators Units\",\"url\":\"https://creatorunits.com\",\"logo\":\"https://creatorunits.com/logo.png\",\"description\":\"Free, fast, and privacy-focused online tools for creators, freelancers, and small businesses.\",\"sameAs\":[],\"contactPoint\":{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer service\",\"email\":\"support@creatorunits.com\",\"availableLanguage\":\"English\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"Creators Units\",\"url\":\"https://creatorunits.com\",\"description\":\"Free online tools for creators, freelancers, and small businesses.\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools?q={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":\"required name=search_term_string\"}}</script><script>\n              (function() {\n                try {\n                  const savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('theme');\n                  const systemPrefersDark = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches;\n                  const theme = savedTheme || (systemPrefersDark ? 'dark' : 'light');\n                  document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\n                } catch (e) {}\n              })();\n            </script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div style=\"visibility:hidden\" class=\"page-wrapper\"><a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-to-content\">Skip to content</a><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"Color Picker & Extractor\",\"url\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/image/color-picker\",\"applicationCategory\":\"UtilityApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"All\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires HTML5, Javascript, Canvas\",\"description\":\"Extract colors from images or use the visual palette builder to get HEX/RGB codes.\"}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is a color picker tool?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A color picker tool is a utility that allows designers and developers to identify and copy exact color codes from an image or visual canvas. By uploading a screenshot or graphic, users can hover over any pixel to extract its color values, simplifying branding workflows and web design coding. It eliminates the guesswork of matching colors by eye.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I find a HEX color code?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"To find a HEX color code, upload your image to our color picker, move the magnifying lens over your target color, and click. The tool immediately extracts the six-character hexadecimal code (e.g., #FF5733) and displays it on your screen with a quick copy button for clipboard saving. You can then paste it directly into your CSS or design tool.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use the selected colors in web design?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, all extracted color codes are fully compatible with web design standards. You can copy HEX, RGB, or HSL values and paste them directly into CSS, HTML styling, graphic design editors like Figma or Photoshop, or branding kits to maintain complete color accuracy across platforms. Every format works seamlessly in professional workflows.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What color formats are supported?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Our color picker tool supports the three most common digital color formats: HEX (hexadecimal codes for web design), RGB (Red, Green, Blue intensity values), and HSL (Hue, Saturation, Lightness coordinates). This allows you to copy whichever format matches your design project or coding environment. Switching between formats is instant with a single click.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why is color consistency important?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Color consistency is critical for brand recognition and user experience. Using the exact same shades across your logo, website headers, call-to-action buttons, and social media templates establishes trust. A color picker helps you maintain this consistency by matching color values across all media formats. Consistent colors make your brand instantly recognizable to your audience.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://creatorunits.com/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Image Tools\",\"item\":\"https://creatorunits.com/category/image\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Color Picker & Extractor\",\"item\":\"https://creatorunits.com/tools/image/color-picker\"}]}</script><header class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__header\" role=\"banner\"><div class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__nav container\"><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__logo\" aria-label=\"Creators Units - Go to homepage\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__logoIcon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13\" y=\"3\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"13\" y=\"13\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__logoText\">Creators Units</span></a><nav class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__menu\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link Header-module__lnUIdW__linkActive\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"/tools\">Explore Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/category/image\">Image Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/category/creator\">Creator Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/category/social\">Social Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/category/utility\">Utility Tools</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__link \" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__actions\"><button class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__themeToggle\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark mode\" title=\"Toggle to dark theme\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z\"></path></svg></button><button class=\"Header-module__lnUIdW__menuToggle\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"main-content section\" id=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;font-size:0.85rem\"><ol style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;align-items:center\"><li><a style=\"color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin:0 0.5rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">/</li><li><a style=\"color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none\" href=\"/category/image\">Image Tools</a></li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin:0 0.5rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">/</li><li aria-current=\"page\" style=\"color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:600\">Color Picker &amp; Extractor</li></ol></nav><div style=\"margin-bottom:2rem\"><h1 style=\"font-size:2.25rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Color Picker &amp; Extractor</h1><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:0\">Extract colors from images or use the visual palette builder to get HEX/RGB codes.</p></div><section style=\"margin-bottom:3rem\" aria-label=\"Color Picker &amp; Extractor tool interface\"><!--$!--><template data-dgst=\"BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING\"></template><!--/$--></section><div class=\"grid-cols-2\" style=\"gap:2rem;margin-bottom:3rem\"><div class=\"card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">📋 How to Use</h2><ol style=\"padding-left:1.25rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.9rem\"><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Upload any image or screenshot to the viewer.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Move your mouse or finger over the image preview; a magnified lens will show colors.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Click on the image to sample a color and add it to your palette.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Copy HEX, RGB, or HSL codes with one click.</li></ol></div><div class=\"card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">⚡ Key Features</h2><ul style=\"padding-left:1.25rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.9rem;list-style-type:square\"><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Interactive Eye-Dropper: Extract exact pixels from graphics.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">HEX, RGB, HSL support.</li><li style=\"color:var(--text-secondary)\">Palette Builder: Save sampled colors to a temporary dashboard list.</li></ul></div></div><section class=\"card\" style=\"background-color:var(--bg-primary);padding:2.5rem;margin-bottom:3.5rem\"><h2 style=\"font-size:1.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">Sample Colors and Create Harmonious Palettes</h2><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\">Found a color you love in a screenshot or photo? Upload it to our Image Color Picker to get the exact HEX, RGB, and HSL values instantly.</p><div style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.75;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem\">\n<h3>Speed Up Design Workflows</h3>\n<p>Instead of opening heavy desktop editor apps just to pick a color, Creators Units allows designers, developers, and creators to drag screenshots right into the browser and capture hex codes in seconds. Build design palettes that ensure perfect brand consistency.</p>\n    </div></section><section style=\"margin-bottom:3.5rem\" aria-labelledby=\"tool-faq-heading\"><h2 id=\"tool-faq-heading\" class=\"text-center mb-6\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto\"><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">What is a color picker tool?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">A color picker tool is a utility that allows designers and developers to identify and copy exact color codes from an image or visual canvas. By uploading a screenshot or graphic, users can hover over any pixel to extract its color values, simplifying branding workflows and web design coding. It eliminates the guesswork of matching colors by eye.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">How do I find a HEX color code?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">To find a HEX color code, upload your image to our color picker, move the magnifying lens over your target color, and click. The tool immediately extracts the six-character hexadecimal code (e.g., #FF5733) and displays it on your screen with a quick copy button for clipboard saving. You can then paste it directly into your CSS or design tool.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">Can I use the selected colors in web design?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">Yes, all extracted color codes are fully compatible with web design standards. You can copy HEX, RGB, or HSL values and paste them directly into CSS, HTML styling, graphic design editors like Figma or Photoshop, or branding kits to maintain complete color accuracy across platforms. Every format works seamlessly in professional workflows.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">What color formats are supported?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">Our color picker tool supports the three most common digital color formats: HEX (hexadecimal codes for web design), RGB (Red, Green, Blue intensity values), and HSL (Hue, Saturation, Lightness coordinates). This allows you to copy whichever format matches your design project or coding environment. Switching between formats is instant with a single click.</p></details><details class=\"card\"><summary style=\"font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;padding:0.5rem 0;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">Why is color consistency important?<span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--success)\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.9rem;margin:0.5rem 0 0 0;padding-top:0.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border-color)\">Color consistency is critical for brand recognition and user experience. Using the exact same shades across your logo, website headers, call-to-action buttons, and social media templates establishes trust. A color picker helps you maintain this consistency by matching color values across all media formats. Consistent colors make your brand instantly recognizable to your audience.</p></details></div></section><section style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-color);padding-top:3rem\" aria-labelledby=\"related-heading\"><h2 id=\"related-heading\" class=\"mb-6\">Related <!-- -->Image Tools</h2><div class=\"grid-cols-4\"><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Open Image Compressor - Compress PNG, JPG, and WebP images directly in your browser without losing quality.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-compressor\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">Image Compressor</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical\">Compress PNG, JPG, and WebP images directly in your browser without losing quality.</p></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit;padding:1.25rem\" aria-label=\"Open Image Resizer - Resize images to custom pixel dimensions or preset percentages with aspect ratio lock.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-resizer\"><h3 style=\"font-size:1rem;margin:0\">Image Resizer</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.8rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical\">Resize images to custom pixel dimensions or preset percentages with aspect ratio lock.</p></a><a class=\"card card-